---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service — SWP Intelligence Engine" description="Terms of Service and Financial Disclaimer for SWP Intelligence Engine.">
	<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300 space-y-6">
		<div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 pb-6 mb-8">
			<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
				Terms of Service
			</h1>
			<p class="text-xs text-slate-400 dark:text-zinc-500 mt-2 font-mono">
				Last Updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}
			</p>
		</div>

		<section class="space-y-4">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-zinc-100">1. Educational & Informational Purpose Only</h2>
			<p class="leading-relaxed">
				The <strong>SWP Intelligence Engine</strong> (including all Monte Carlo simulations, percentile curves, schedule tables, and health metrics) is provided strictly for <strong>educational and informational purposes only</strong>.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="space-y-4 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-900/60 p-5 rounded-xl">
			<h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200 flex items-center gap-2">
				<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
					<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/>
				</svg>
				Strict Financial Advice Disclaimer
			</h2>
			<p class="text-sm text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 leading-relaxed">
				This tool does <strong>NOT</strong> constitute certified financial advice, investment management, or tax counseling. The creators and developers of this software are not certified financial planners, registered investment advisors (RIAs), or tax accountants. You should consult with a qualified, licensed financial professional before making any financial or investment decisions.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="space-y-4">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-zinc-100">2. Limitation of Liability</h2>
			<p class="leading-relaxed">
				Under no circumstances shall the creators, owners, or operators of SWP Intelligence Engine be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or pecuniary damages arising out of your use of or reliance on the calculations, simulations, projections, or schedule outputs generated by this platform.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="space-y-4">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-zinc-100">3. Simulation Model Limitations</h2>
			<p class="leading-relaxed">
				Monte Carlo simulations use stochastic mathematical models based on statistical standard deviations. They cannot predict future black swan events, regulatory changes, or individual tax modifications. Past performance and simulated probabilities are not guarantees of future investment returns.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="space-y-4">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-zinc-100">4. Modification of Terms</h2>
			<p class="leading-relaxed">
				We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time without prior notice. By continuing to use this website, you agree to be bound by the current version of these Terms of Service.
			</p>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
